2026-08-31  David Walther  <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>

	* mount.filsys.c, findfs.filsys.c: renamed from filsysmount.c and
	  filsysfind.c to match the `<verb>.filsys` binary names.
	* mkfs.filsys.c: new tool; create a V7 filesystem (superblock, i-list,
	  interleaved free list, root directory) in a disk image.  -o block
	  offset; -b boot block (a PDP-11 a.out, V7 magic 0407).
	* fsck.filsys.c: new tool; thin wrapper over v7fs_check().
	* mkfs.filsys.1, fsck.filsys.1, findfs.filsys.1, mount.filsys.1:
	  renamed man pages with .SH NAME lines so `man -k` finds them.
	* Makefile.am, configure.ac, .gitignore, packaging/, README.distributions,
	  COPYING, NEWS: updated for the new tool names and the two new tools.

2026-08-26  David Walther  <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>

	* configure.ac, Makefile.am: GNU autotools build (configure && make
	  && make install).  pkg-config fuse3 with a no-root fallback.
	* filsysmount.1: man page.
	* COPYING, AUTHORS, NEWS, ChangeLog: GNU standard files.

2026-08-25  David Walther  <david@clearbrookdistillery.com>

	* filsysmount.c, v7fs.c, v7fs.h: first working driver.  Middle-endian
	  V7 filesystem access, allocation mirroring sys/alloc.c, FUSE
	  callbacks, and a free-list/inode-table integrity check (-c).
